{
    "name": "Demo SurveyMonkey - Responses Report",
    "type": "automation",
    "wizard": {
        "fields": []
    },
    "notes": {
        "a51c0de0-5e11-4c02-9a02-0000000000aa": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 64,
            "width": 912,
            "height": 208,
            "content": "## 📊 Responses Report\n\nOn start, the flow reads a survey, **exports all its responses to a CSV file** and e-mails the file to the team together with the survey totals and links to the results in SurveyMonkey.\n\n- Connect your SurveyMonkey account and pick the survey in the **Get the survey** step.\n- Change the recipient in the **E-mail the report** step (demo sends to `test@appmixer.com`).\n- Replace **On Start** with a **Scheduler** trigger to send the report every week."
        }
    },
    "flow": {
        "a51c0de0-5e11-4c02-9a02-000000000001": {
            "type": "appmixer.utils.controls.OnStart",
            "label": "On start",
            "x": 64,
            "y": 320,
            "source": {},
            "config": {}
        },
        "a51c0de0-5e11-4c02-9a02-000000000002": {
            "type": "appmixer.surveymonkey.core.GetSurvey",
            "label": "Get the survey",
            "x": 272,
            "y": 320,
            "version": "1.0.0",
            "source": {
                "in": {
                    "a51c0de0-5e11-4c02-9a02-000000000001": [
                        "out"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "config": {
                "transform": {
                    "in": {
                        "a51c0de0-5e11-4c02-9a02-000000000001": {
                            "out": {
                                "type": "json2new",
                                "modifiers": {
                                    "surveyId": {}
                                },
                                "lambda": {
                                    "surveyId": "529066657"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "a51c0de0-5e11-4c02-9a02-000000000003": {
            "type": "appmixer.surveymonkey.core.ListResponses",
            "label": "Export responses to CSV",
            "x": 480,
            "y": 320,
            "version": "1.0.0",
            "source": {
                "in": {
                    "a51c0de0-5e11-4c02-9a02-000000000002": [
                        "out"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "config": {
                "transform": {
                    "in": {
                        "a51c0de0-5e11-4c02-9a02-000000000002": {
                            "out": {
                                "type": "json2new",
                                "modifiers": {
                                    "surveyId": {
                                        "survey-id": {
                                            "variable": "$.a51c0de0-5e11-4c02-9a02-000000000002.out.id",
                                            "functions": []
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "simple": {},
                                    "outputType": {}
                                },
                                "lambda": {
                                    "surveyId": "{{{survey-id}}}",
                                    "simple": true,
                                    "outputType": "file"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "a51c0de0-5e11-4c02-9a02-000000000004": {
            "type": "appmixer.utils.email.SendEmail",
            "label": "E-mail the report",
            "x": 688,
            "y": 320,
            "version": "1.1.1",
            "source": {
                "in": {
                    "a51c0de0-5e11-4c02-9a02-000000000003": [
                        "out"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "config": {
                "transform": {
                    "in": {
                        "a51c0de0-5e11-4c02-9a02-000000000003": {
                            "out": {
                                "type": "json2new",
                                "modifiers": {
                                    "to": {},
                                    "subject": {
                                        "s-title": {
                                            "variable": "$.a51c0de0-5e11-4c02-9a02-000000000002.out.title",
                                            "functions": []
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "html": {
                                        "h-title": {
                                            "variable": "$.a51c0de0-5e11-4c02-9a02-000000000002.out.title",
                                            "functions": []
                                        },
                                        "h-responses": {
                                            "variable": "$.a51c0de0-5e11-4c02-9a02-000000000002.out.response_count",
                                            "functions": []
                                        },
                                        "h-questions": {
                                            "variable": "$.a51c0de0-5e11-4c02-9a02-000000000002.out.question_count",
                                            "functions": []
                                        },
                                        "h-modified": {
                                            "variable": "$.a51c0de0-5e11-4c02-9a02-000000000002.out.date_modified",
                                            "functions": []
                                        },
                                        "h-analyze": {
                                            "variable": "$.a51c0de0-5e11-4c02-9a02-000000000002.out.analyze_url",
                                            "functions": []
                                        },
                                        "h-summary": {
                                            "variable": "$.a51c0de0-5e11-4c02-9a02-000000000002.out.summary_url",
                                            "functions": []
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "attachments": {
                                        "a-file": {
                                            "variable": "$.a51c0de0-5e11-4c02-9a02-000000000003.out.fileId",
                                            "functions": []
                                        }
                                    }
                                },
                                "lambda": {
                                    "to": "test@appmixer.com",
                                    "subject": "Survey report - {{{s-title}}}",
                                    "html": "<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;max-width:600px;color:#222\"><h2 style=\"color:#00BF6F\">Survey responses report</h2><p>The responses of the survey <b>{{{h-title}}}</b> are attached as a CSV file.</p><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\"><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #eee;background:#fafafa\"><b>Survey</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #eee\">{{{h-title}}}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #eee;background:#fafafa\"><b>Responses</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #eee\">{{{h-responses}}}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #eee;background:#fafafa\"><b>Questions</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #eee\">{{{h-questions}}}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #eee;background:#fafafa\"><b>Last modified</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #eee\">{{{h-modified}}}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #eee;background:#fafafa\"><b>Analyze</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #eee\"><a href=\"{{{h-analyze}}}\">Open the results</a></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #eee;background:#fafafa\"><b>Summary</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #eee\"><a href=\"{{{h-summary}}}\">Open the summary</a></td></tr></table><p style=\"color:#888;font-size:12px\">Sent by the Appmixer demo flow “Demo SurveyMonkey - Responses Report”.</p></div>",
                                    "attachments": {
                                        "ADD": [
                                            {
                                                "fileId": "{{{a-file}}}"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }
}
